{"id":475,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"人間教育と理数英語を深める盛岡白百合","feature_description":"盛岡白百合学園は、カトリックの伝統を土台に人間教育、理数・英語教育、白百合スタンダードを組み合わせて学びを進める学校です。高校の教育でも個性と基礎力の両方を大切にし、2026年からの共学化に向けた改革も進んでいます。学園生活と部活動の両面で生徒の成長を支えます。寮や学園施設も含め、日常の学びを支える仕組みが整っています。学園全体で学びを後押しする環境があります。","clubs":[{"id":9401,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mshirayuri.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9402,"name":"ハンドボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mshirayuri.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9403,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mshirayuri.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9404,"name":"新体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mshirayuri.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9405,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mshirayuri.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9406,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mshirayuri.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9407,"name":"男子硬式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mshirayuri.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9408,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mshirayuri.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9409,"name":"放送部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://mshirayuri.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9410,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://mshirayuri.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9411,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://mshirayuri.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9412,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://mshirayuri.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9413,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://mshirayuri.jp/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9414,"name":"合唱部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://